---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Dark Matter Galaxy Formation Mechanisms Cheat Sheet | Free Hierarchical, Cooling, Feedback"
  description="Complete dark matter galaxy formation mechanisms cheat sheet with hierarchical, cooling, and feedback. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Dark Matter Galaxy Formation Mechanisms<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Hierarchical, cooling, and feedback. From dark matter halos to galaxy formation.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Hierarchical Formation</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Process</h3>
        <pre><code>Dark matter halos merge first
Gas falls into potential wells
Cooling and fragmentation
First stars form (Pop III)
Mergers drive evolution</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Cooling</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Cooling Mechanisms</h3>
        <pre><code>Atomic cooling: H, He line emission
Molecular cooling: H₂ rotation lines
Metal cooling: C, O, Fe lines
Compton cooling: CMB photon scattering
Bremsstrahlung: free-free emission</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Feedback</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Types</h3>
        <pre><code>AGN feedback: heating from central black hole
Stellar feedback: supernovae, stellar winds
Photoionization: UV radiation from stars
Chemical enrichment: metals from stars
Magnetic fields: pressure support</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Merger Driven</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Merge Types</h3>
        <pre><code>Major merger: mass ratio < 1:3
Minor merger: mass ratio > 1:3
Dry merger: gas-poor, no star formation
Wet merger: gas-rich, starburst
Triggered star formation and AGN activity</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
